Wroat is the capital of [[Breland]], seat of the Brelish Parliament and residence of King [[Boranel ir'Wynarn]]. It sits at the confluence of the [[Howling River]] and [[Lurching River]], roughly central within Breland's territory.

Where [[Sharn]] is the commercial heart of Breland, Wroat is the political heart. The [[Citadel]] (Breland's intelligence service) is headquartered here, as is the Brelish Parliament.

!! Notable Sites
* [[Brelish Parliament]] — bicameral legislature with surprising democratic power
* [[The Citadel]] — Breland's spy and law enforcement agency; operates nationwide
* [[Boldrei's Hearth]] — famous inn frequented by parliamentarians and spies alike
* [[Shining Valley]] — noble quarter

!! Political Climate (996 YK)
Breland chafes under the [[Thronehold Accords]]. King Boranel is aging and his succession is uncertain. The Parliament faction pushing for a republic gains strength. The Citadel increasingly acts on its own authority.

